  "limitations": [
    "Model-derived solar geometry only: not observed irradiance, radiance, shadow fraction, or ionizing radiation.",
    "Flat biaxial-ellipsoid tangent plane; no DEM terrain horizon, shadow mask, observer height, atmosphere or cloud model.",
    "The AOI is placed on the reference biaxial ellipsoid; source DEM elevations and observer heights are not added.",
    "Sun position is the light-time-corrected body-centre vector from SPICE; site parallax is applied by vector subtraction.",
    "Point AOI centres; not a spatial average over the existing 1.98 km DEM windows and not global coverage.",
    "Moon uses MOON_ME realised from DE421; Mars uses IAU_MARS from pck00011. Source projected-CRS registration is a documented assumption, not an independent geodetic validation.",
